    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en\"><head><meta charSet=\"utf-8\"/><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/0c89a48fa5027cee-s.p.0rd3rjvnnhw7n.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/797e433ab948586e-s.p.09zddjkbdep5a.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"preload\" href=\"/_next/static/media/caa3a2e1cccd8315-s.p.09~u27dqhyhd6.woff2\" as=\"font\" crossorigin=\"\" type=\"font/woff2\"/><link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/0hj4kes54m-b8.css\" data-precedence=\"next\"/><link rel=\"preload\" as=\"script\" fetchPriority=\"low\" href=\"/_next/static/chunks/15xrurgzs99gv.js\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0p5.qr0b94vxo.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0bogtdbh.dcu1.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/turbopack-0ilhzh264ohne.js\" async=\"\"></script><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/0dbhjjzl8qfwv.js\" async=\"\"></script><meta name=\"next-size-adjust\" content=\"\"/><title>Ironsail - About</title><meta name=\"description\" content=\"Learn about Ironsail, the next-generation blockchain gaming alliance\"/><meta name=\"generator\" content=\"v0.app\"/><link rel=\"icon\" href=\"/favicon.ico?favicon.0x3dzn~oxb6tn.ico\" sizes=\"256x256\" type=\"image/x-icon\"/><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/03~yq9q893hmn.js\" noModule=\"\"></script></head><body class=\"space_grotesk_56ebcc6d-module__h15UTa__variable antialiased\"><div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><main class=\"min-h-screen bg-black text-white font-space-grotesk\"><section class=\"bg-black pt-20 pb-16 px-4 md:px-8\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-4 text-balance\">About Ironsail</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-300 text-balance\">Sail the Open Metaverse</p></div></section><section class=\"bg-black px-4 md:px-8 py-12 border-t border-gray-800\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-200 leading-relaxed\">Ironsail is a next-generation blockchain gaming alliance, connecting visionary studios and players through interoperable worlds, shared economies, and true digital ownership.</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-200 leading-relaxed mt-6\">Our mission is simple — to build a sustainable bridge between traditional gaming excellence and the future of Web3 entertainment.</p></div></section><section class=\"bg-black px-4 md:px-8 py-16 border-t border-gray-800\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-8\">Our Mission</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-200 leading-relaxed mb-6\">To redefine the relationship between games, players, and creators.</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-200 leading-relaxed\">Ironsail empowers independent studios to bring their best titles to the blockchain, while ensuring players enjoy genuine ownership of their assets, achievements, and in-game economies. We believe in a future where every game is a world, and every world is part of a connected metaverse.</p></div></section><section class=\"bg-black px-4 md:px-8 py-16 border-t border-gray-800\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-10\">Ecosystem Structure</h2><div class=\"space-y-10\"><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Owning Entity: HOK – House of Kaisers</h3><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">HOK is the strategic owner and operator of the Ironsail brand. It oversees governance, IP management, and ecosystem growth across the entire metaverse initiative.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Token Issuer: Topegg LTD</h3><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">Topegg serves as the blockchain publishing and tokenization arm of the ecosystem — managing token issuance, cross-game integration, and the shared economic layer for all Ironsail-licensed titles. Topegg is wholly owned by HOK.</p></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold mb-3\">Development &amp; Publishing Network</h3><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-4\">Ironsail operates under a licensing and integration model. All games featured under the Ironsail brand are developed and owned by independent studios. Ironsail licenses these titles and provides the Web3 integration layer — including token design, NFT systems, cross-game interoperability, and blockchain infrastructure.</p><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed mb-6\">This structure allows studios to focus on what they do best — building engaging gameplay and content — while Ironsail ensures a unified, scalable Web3 ecosystem connecting all games through shared technology and economy.</p><div><h4 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-4\">Participating Studios:</h4><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3\"><div class=\"text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-accent\">•</span> <!-- -->Whydah</div><div class=\"text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-accent\">•</span> <!-- -->HIKER Games</div><div class=\"text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-accent\">•</span> <!-- -->IMBA</div><div class=\"text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-accent\">•</span> <!-- -->Divmob</div><div class=\"text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-accent\">•</span> <!-- -->Greengame</div><div class=\"text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-accent\">•</span> <!-- -->Topebox</div><div class=\"text-gray-300 flex items-center gap-2\"><span class=\"text-accent\">•</span> <!-- -->Genesis</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-black px-4 md:px-8 py-16 border-t border-gray-800\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-10\">The Seven Worlds</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-200 leading-relaxed mb-10\">Ironsail unites seven flagship games, each representing a distinct world within its connected metaverse — spanning genres from action to strategy, racing, and casual play.</p><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"border-l-2 border-accent pl-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold underline text-accent mb-2\"><a href=\"https://x.com/mytheria_myra\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Mytheria: Clash of Pantheons</a></h3><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">A &quot;Create-to-Earn&quot; card battler that brings global mythologies and player creativity together through art, strategy, and community-driven design.</p></div><div class=\"border-l-2 border-accent pl-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold underline text-accent mb-2\"><a href=\"https://x.com/ark_rivals\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Ark Rivals</a></h3><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">A sci-fi strategy and base-building game where players wage interplanetary wars, mine resources, and build empires in the Arkverse.</p></div><div class=\"border-l-2 border-accent pl-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold underline text-accent mb-2\"><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.hikergames.krabots&amp;hl=en_SG\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Krabots</a></h3><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">A fast-paced robotic combat game — where players engineer, customize, and battle mecha-powered crabs in competitive arenas.</p></div><div class=\"border-l-2 border-accent pl-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold underline text-accent mb-2\"><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=co.imba.overleague.metaverse&amp;hl=en\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Overleague</a></h3><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">A futuristic racing experience blending car collection, customization, and PvP racing — where each vehicle is a tradable digital asset.</p></div><div class=\"border-l-2 border-accent pl-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold underline text-accent mb-2\"><a href=\"https://x.com/pet_tap_tap\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Pet Tap Tap</a></h3><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">A relaxing pet-raising and idle-clicker game that rewards bonding, collection, and care across a universe of adorable NFT companions.</p></div><div class=\"border-l-2 border-accent pl-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold underline text-accent mb-2\"><a href=\"https://x.com/onchamon\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Onchamon</a></h3><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">A creature-collecting adventure where players explore, train, and evolve unique digital monsters — each with distinct abilities and rarity.</p></div><div class=\"border-l-2 border-accent pl-6\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold underline text-accent mb-2\"><a href=\"https://slimebound.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Slimebound</a></h3><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">A lighthearted RPG featuring mischievous slimes, fusion mechanics, and exploration — combining casual fun with tokenized progression.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-black px-4 md:px-8 py-16 border-t border-gray-800\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-10\">Why Ironsail</h2><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-gray-900 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-800\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-accent\">Collaborative Power</h3><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">Multiple studios, one unified vision.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-900 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-800\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-accent\">True Ownership</h3><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">Players own NFTs, assets, and in-game progress across worlds.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-900 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-800\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-accent\">Interoperable Economy</h3><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">Powered by Topegg for seamless token and asset integration.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-900 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-800\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-accent\">Proven Developers</h3><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">Built by leading Vietnamese studios with global recognition.</p></div><div class=\"bg-gray-900 p-6 rounded-lg border border-gray-800\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold mb-3 text-accent\">Scalable Universe</h3><p class=\"text-gray-300 leading-relaxed\">A growing portfolio of worlds connected by technology, economy, and creativity.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-black px-4 md:px-8 py-16 border-t border-gray-800\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto\"><h2 class=\"text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">Join the Voyage</h2><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-200 leading-relaxed mb-10\">Ironsail is more than a collection of games — it&#x27;s a movement redefining how studios, creators, and players build the future of gaming together. Whether you are a player, creator, or partner, come aboard and shape the open metaverse with us.</p><div class=\"space-y-4 text-lg\"><p class=\"text-gray-300\"><a href=\"https://houseofkaisers.com\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-accent\">🌐 houseofkaisers.com</a></p><p class=\"text-gray-300\"><a href=\"mailto:contact@houseofkaisers.com\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"text-accent\">📧 contact@houseofkaisers.com</a></p></div></div></section><footer class=\"bg-black border-t border-gray-800 px-4 md:px-8 py-8\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center text-gray-500 text-sm\"><p>© 2025 Ironsail. Powered by House of Kaisers.</p></div></footer></main><!--$--><!--/$--><script src=\"/_next/static/chunks/15xrurgzs99gv.js\" id=\"_R_\" async=\"\"></script><script>(self.__next_f=self.__next_f||[]).push([0])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,\"1:\\\"$Sreact.fragment\\\"\\n2:I[39756,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0dbhjjzl8qfwv.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\n3:I[37457,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0dbhjjzl8qfwv.js\\\"],\\\"default\\\"]\\nc:I[68027,[\\\"/_next/static/chunks/0dbhjjzl8qfwv.js\\\"],\\\"default